{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19296","headline":"和兵部郑侍郎省中四松诗十韵 · 刘禹锡","name":"和兵部郑侍郎省中四松诗十韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"右相历中台，移松武库栽。\n紫茸抽组绶，青实长玫瑰。\n便有干霄势，看成构厦材。\n数分天柱半，影逐日轮回。\n旧赏台阶去，新知谷口来。\n息阴常仰望，翫境几裴回。\n翠粒晴悬露，苍鳞雨起苔。\n凝音助瑶瑟，飘蘂泛金罍。\n月桂花遥烛，星榆叶对开。\n终须似鸡树，荣茂近昭回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19296.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19296","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}